        0
      ],
      "wander": 4,
      "chatter": [
        "Four hands, four knives, and still no trade that will have me.",
        "Nobody here asks what is in the flask on my back. That is manners."
      ],
      "talk": {
        "hello": [
          "Bleeding? No? Pity. Buying, then.",
          "Four hands, four knives, and every one of them clean. Mostly."
        ],
        "ask": [
          {
            "q": "What are these draughts made of?",
            "a": "Fen herbs. Pond water, boiled. And a little of what I take out of people, cleaned up. You'd be amazed what blood can do."
          },
          {
            "q": "Is it safe out on the water?",
            "a": "Safe for me. I fly."
          }
        ],
        "sells": [
          {
            "item": "herbs"
          },
          {
            "item": "red_draught"
          },
          {
            "item": "blue_draught"
          },
          {
            "item": "green_draught"
          }
        ],
        "shop": "Physic, fresh as the fen allows.",
        "sold": "Drink it slowly. Or don't. I'm not your mother.",
        "bye": "Come back when you're bleeding."
      }
    },
